# ML artifacts — checkpoints, processed data, scalers, and metrics ARE
# committed on purpose: the deployed backend (Hugging Face Space) has no
# free GPU/CPU budget to retrain on deploy, so it serves these files as-is.
# Only truly regenerable/log noise stays ignored:
backend/logs/*.log
backend/data/raw_gold_data.parquet
catboost_info/
backend/backend-install.log
backend/.pytest_cache/

